      "id": 131351,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-12T00:23:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The damage to earn a point is by target, so in your example as soon as Hero A deals the second target the 2 damage the heroes earn a point.</p><p>As soon as Hero B deals the second target the 2 damage the heroes earn a point. &nbsp;The damage dealt by the power is irrelevant, that hero already earned their point for dealing 2 damage to 2 targets in a round, and cannot earn another point for achieving that until the next round.</p><p>If Expat uses her assault rifle to deal 3 targets 2 damage on her turn she gets a point, is that same round Adept lets her use a power and she does it again, she gets no more points, because it isn't a new round yet.</p><p>Hero C deals no damage, is awarded no points, and may God have mercy on their soul.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:06:39.404Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
